## Status

- **Status:** active
- **Updated:** 2026-09-20

## Project

- **Name:** Volleyball Manager (`volleyball-manager`)
- **Purpose:** Club platform for admins, coaches, players, and parents — seasons, rosters, live game stats, volunteering, announcements, seasonal archives.
- **Audience:** Youth/club volleyball programs (roles: ADMIN, COACH, PLAYER, PARENT).
- **Stack:** Next.js App Router + Tailwind (`apps/web-client`); NestJS (`apps/api-server`); PostgreSQL + Prisma (`packages/database`); Socket.io; npm workspaces; Docker Compose. Not golden path / not Vercel-first.
- **Package manager:** npm (workspaces; app packages not scaffolded yet)
- **Deploy target:** Local Docker Compose first. Production host unset.

## Current focus

- Branch `cursor/start-new-app-b09f`. Plan is written; **do not scaffold until implementing `docs/first-slice.md`**.
- Demo moment: coach records a live stat; parent board updates over Socket.io.
